Package: NetRecover
Type: Package
Title: Gaussian Graphical Network Estimation and Recovery
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Chuanhao", "Yang",
      email = "ch.yang@tamu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides tools for simulating Gaussian graphical models,
    estimating sparse precision matrices using graphical lasso,
    and evaluating network recovery performance through repeated
    simulations. Planned functionality includes computing performance
    metrics such as true positive rate, false positive rate,
    and false discovery rate, as well as visualizing estimated networks.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
